{"type":"text","timestamp":1790375246090,"sessionID":"ses_f2555c600ffeSC0hgk1m5TIVO8","part":{"id":"prt_0daae38f7001U2iilx7UDGbNq2","messageID":"msg_0daadf15b001QXU5NtFAVDLFF9","sessionID":"ses_f2555c600ffeSC0hgk1m5TIVO8","type":"text","text":"The runtime check found two scene-load ordering issues: exported node references were not being resolved because the scene lacked `node_paths`, and stats could be assigned before the range node was ready. I’ve added explicit node-path metadata and made `DetectRange` apply its configuration both from the setter and `_ready()`.","time":{"start":1790375246071,"end":1790375246073},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0706abecd4c9b1f4016ab6f54974b48194b887619ed168b077","phase":"commentary"}}}}
