{"type":"text","timestamp":1790375356600,"sessionID":"ses_f2555c600ffeSC0hgk1m5TIVO8","part":{"id":"prt_0daafe8a5001MgSx0exLftwa3k","messageID":"msg_0daafbb7e001DQapEwb9nCv6bd","sessionID":"ses_f2555c600ffeSC0hgk1m5TIVO8","type":"text","text":"Implemented the arena bot sensor targeting setup.\n\nChanged:\n\n- Added `UnitStats.TARGET` opposing-group lookup in [unit_stats.gd](/workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd:6).\n- Added [detect_range.gd](/workspace/custom_nodes/detect_range.gd:1):\n  - `DetectRange` class extending `Area2D`\n  - Configures collision layers and masks from team\n  - Creates a circular detection shape based on attack range\n- Added [target_finder.gd](/workspace/custom_nodes/target_finder.gd:1):\n  - Tracks `BattleUnit` instances entering and leaving range\n  - Emits `targets_in_range_changed`\n  - Finds the closest opposing unit using groups and squared distance\n- Updated [battle_unit.gd](/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd:4) with `detect_range` and `target_finder` references and stats propagation.\n- Updated [battle_unit.tscn](/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn:22) with wired `DetectRange`, collision shape, and `TargetFinder` nodes.\n\nValidation completed successfully with Godot 4.4.1:\n\n- Editor project scan passed.\n- Headless game startup passed without errors.\n- Runtime checks passed for collision setup, sensor radii, nearest-target selection, enter/exit signals, filtering non-unit areas, empty groups, and stats reassignment.\n- Captured and inspected a game frame, then removed generated validation artifacts.","time":{"start":1790375356582,"end":1790375356586},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0706abecd4c9b1f4016ab6f5b374b881949dd34241ae6ef378","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
